<template id="guide-page-3">
    <h2>Ready to Dive In?</h2>
    <p>Start your Metroidvania journey now! Create your first project today and bring your map, mechanics, and moodboard to life.</p>
    <div class="guide-summary">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Make your Game</strong> design a map with secrets, shortcuts, and memorable rooms.</li>
            <li><strong>Build experience</strong> learn new techniques!</li>
            <li><strong>Share it:</strong> have others experience your game!</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <p>Once you've got a project idea, jump into setup, add your first level, and share it with the community.</p>
    
    <div class="guide-actions">
        <button id="guide-back-button" type="button" class="btn-retro">Back</button>
        <%= link_to "Go", setup_path, class: "btn-retro", style:"background:#00AB66", id:"get-started-button" %>
    </div>
</template>